/* ot_names.inc — the function sets Apple's 68k Open Transport 1.1 glue
 * binds through the Shared Library Manager, and the name of each index:
 * read with MPW DumpObj from OpenTransport.o, OpenTransportApp.o,
 * OpenTptInet.o and OpenTptUtils.o (E.T.O. #22). Each set's client
 * vector record carries its ID and version words; a stub record carries
 * its 1-based index. ot.cpp names binds and missing functions with it.
 * ALL-CAPS names are the pascal entries the glue's header declares
 * pascal; the others are C (the ...Priv ones take the glue's client
 * record last). */

